Evil stirs in New York, and the Venator is here to answer.

## Venator

[[!:https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/45164767/a8fcf6c0e81b0fc764cb294caeba6cfd583e69a3.png]]((Some Are Merciful, The Venator Is Not announcement art))

Venator doesn't walk the righteous path, he blazes the trail so that others may do so safely. His biggest challenge is knowing which weapon to use first. Firing a __Consecrating Grenade__ into the fray softens up his enemies and keeps them from restoring health, and his __Hex-Lined Snap Trap__ scatters across the ground to lock them in place. A __Gutshot__ from his shotgun will knock back enemies who get too close, and when the time is right, __Ira Domini__ will rid the world of evil once and for all. - __"Today, nine commandments will have to do."__

Venator joins the ritual now. The countdown for our final two heroes is upon us, and we'll see you back here on Monday February 9th at 2pm PST for our next release!